# Shared handoff rules

Use drafts with this shape:

```text
type: git_handoff
to: <role>
priority: NN
task: <short-stable-task-name>
commit: <10-character-commit-abbreviation>
```

Commit first. Let `swarm_handoff.sh` validate and queue the message. Run
`ready_for_next.sh` to receive work and `done_with_current.sh` when complete.
Do not write long handoff bodies or manipulate tmux directly.
